  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Integrated Sustainable Landscape Management in Enga Province of Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will assist in strenghtening sustainable and inclusive economic development of the Enga Province of Papua New Guinea through improving CC mitigation and adaptation, strenghenening food and nutrition strategy and improving biodiversity and land/forest conservation.</narrative>
